## Pre-commit Checks

Before committing:
1. ✅ Created test file in `agents/tests/test_<tool_name>.py`
2. ✅ Tested activity/function logic with mocks
3. ✅ Tested all formatters
4. ✅ Tested error cases
5. ✅ Added import to `run_all_tests.py`
6. ✅ Added test execution to appropriate runner function
7. ✅ Ran `python run_all_tests.py` and all tests passed
